 "_comment": "CANDIDATE API migrations. Regexes are applied to single added/removed diff lines. A file in a commit is a candidate conversion if it removes >=1 'old' line and adds >=1 'new' line. Candidates are verified separately before use; patterns are deliberately simple and may be noisy.",
